\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (2,3);
\draw (2,0) rectangle (4,3);
\draw (4,0) rectangle (6,3);
\draw (6,0) rectangle (8,3);
\draw (2,3)--(3,4.5)--(4,3);
\draw (2,0)--(3,-1.5)--(4,0);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

This net for a rectangular prism has been started as a strip of four rectangles. How many more faces are needed to complete the net, and what shape are they?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}, scale=0.7]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (2,1.5);
\draw (0,1.5) rectangle (2,3);
\draw (0,3) rectangle (2,4.5);
\draw (0,4.5) rectangle (2,6);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
